
#basePath Chapter11

::OnContractSelectOpenCh11
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Arken}    How're feeling Locke? 
{@Player}   Feeling relieved. 
{@Arken} 	That’s good.
{@Arken} 	I’m here to help out as much as I can. 
{@Arken}	I’m not there physically but I am always there for you Locke. 
{@Locke}	Thanks, Arken.

::AfterResearchCh11
@trigger 
@when           IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}        Did you do it?
{@Player}       I did it. 
{@Quinn}        Good.
{@Joel}         Good riddance. 
{@Callie}       Yea, good riddance! 
{@Player}       ...Callie? 
{@Joel}         The Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station??
{@Quinn}        I thought your station blew up. 
{@Callie}       You thought correctly!
{@Joel}         How did you even get on this channel?
{@Callie}       Well... I may or more not have commandeered your smallest hauler.
{@Quinn}        That's so rad. 
{@Callie}       I was going to run, but I realized this was one of your ships Clackey. 
{@Callie} 	    So I was thinking… what if I started working for ya? 
{@Player}       Uh...
{@Joel}         I mean, I'm not against it. 
{@Quinn}	    C’mon Locke pleeeeease I want cool space pirate as a co-worker. 
{@Player}       Sure, why not. 
{@Callie}       Thanks Clackey-
{@Callie}       Hmph- I mean, thanks, Captain!


::AfterSupplyChainCh11
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

{@Mai}      So, you got rid of the bots? 
{@Player}   What don't you know? 
{@Mai}      You're favorite color. 
{@Player}   Oh, uh- 
{@Mai}      It's orange. 
{@Player}   Mai, how in the stars- 
{@Mai}      I'm going to be leaving. 
{@Player}   Oh-
{@Mai}      Other things are taking priority. 
{@Mai}      Who knows. 
{@Mai}      Maybe we'll see each other around. 
{@Mai}      Oh...
{@Mai}      Keela says good job. 
{@Player}   Heh... thanks Mai. See you around. Maybe. 

